# Design

## CSS
- Colours, type, spacing: `public/assets/css/tokens.css`.
- Reset/typography: `base.css`. Reusable UI: `components.css`.
- Hand-written CSS. No Bootstrap/Tailwind/etc. unless Paul says so.
- Vanilla JS. No frontend frameworks unless Paul says so.

## Borders & shadows
- **Normal borders and normal shadows are fine.**
- **Forbidden:** heavy coloured one-sided accent borders / AI-style stripes
  (example: `border-left: 4px solid red`, thick coloured side bars).
- Thin structural rules and underlines are OK.
- A brand underline (e.g. `border-bottom: 3px solid var(--gold)`) is a **project call** — ask if unsure.

## First paint
- Server-rendered chrome. Pages must not stay empty until JS fills the shell.
- Progressive JS is fine for boards, maps, and games after first paint.
